"last_played": 1787094087, "avatar": "bd352e46ec4039cfb821de4a3fe86884cb732973"}, "language": "english", "review": "I was honestly thinking that I'd not like this game.\nThat I'd play for a week and move on. \n\nBut I go so involved so fast. The customization is amazing - both mechanically and cosmetically.\nThe movement feels great (except when you get stuck on a random corner of terrain).\nAnd there's so many nuances, so many things to learn, so much that can be done. \nAnd there's the ability to use ANY equipment that you like. ANY equipment can take you through the game, and through most anything you'll want to be doing. \n\nI highly recommend this game, regardless of if you play casually, or you're a tryhard. If you love in-depth mechanics, you'll love learning this game; and if you don't, well you don't need to know them!\n\nI've not played any other game (bar smash) since I started playing, almost six months ago. \nAnd there's so much to do, and so much more coming. It's wonderful.", "timestamp_created": 1546285846, "timestamp_updated": 1546285846, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1364234640", "reactions": []}]}